Note on scope: This MIT License applies to the source code and documentation in
this repository (including but not limited to index.html, prepare_assets.py,
start.py, works.json, the visual-review files, this README, and STATUS.json).

It does NOT extend to the historical scanned images reproduced under assets/.
Those images are derivative renderings of public scan pages from the Internet
Archive item "Selected Photographs from China" (Foreign Languages Press, 1977)
at https://archive.org/details/selectedphotographsfromchina/, and are
reproduced under the lending terms of that archive. Their original
photographers and Foreign Languages Press retain attribution for the
underlying photographs. See ingest-receipt.json for the exact source member
and SHA-256 of every asset file.